    width: 2848
    height: 4288
    caption: Male deity pouring a life-giving water from a vessel. Facade of
      Inanna Temple at Uruk, Iraq. 15th century BC. The Pergamon Museum.
  - file: معبد_كاريوس_...اوروك_...._مدينة_الوركاء_..._المثنى.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3c/%D9%85%D8%B9%D8%A8%D8%AF_%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%88%D8%B3_...%D8%A7%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%83_...._%D9%85%D8%AF%D9%8A%D9%86%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%A1_..._%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%AB%D9%86%D9%89.jpg/250px-%D9%85%D8%B9%D8%A8%D8%AF_%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%8A%D9%88%D8%B3_...%D8%A7%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%88%D9%83_...._%D9%85%D8%AF%D9%8A%D9%86%D8%A9_%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%A1_..._%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D8%AB%D9%86%D9%89.jpg
